	<h2>Description</h2>
<p><strong data-start="0" data-end="87">Curved Glass Water Wall with Stainless Steel Frame at Spa in Dublin, Columbus, Ohio</strong></p>
<p>At the luxurious spa in Dublin, Columbus, Ohio, the Curved Glass Water Wall with a Stainless Steel Frame by Midwest-Tropical creates a serene and elegant ambiance. This beautifully crafted water feature combines the timeless beauty of curved glass with the modern touch of a sleek stainless steel frame, delivering a captivating focal point that enhances relaxation and tranquility.</p>
<h3 data-start="481" data-end="504"><strong data-start="485" data-end="502">Key Features:</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="506" data-end="1120">
<li data-start="506" data-end="659"><strong data-start="508" data-end="540">Stunning Curved Glass Design</strong> &#8211; The gracefully arched glass panel creates a visually appealing flow, adding sophistication to any spa environment.</li>
<li data-start="660" data-end="809"><strong data-start="662" data-end="695">Premium Stainless Steel Frame</strong> &#8211; The durable and corrosion-resistant frame provides structural stability while maintaining a modern aesthetic.</li>
<li data-start="810" data-end="968"><strong data-start="812" data-end="834">Calming Water Flow</strong> &#8211; Water cascades smoothly over the curved glass, producing a gentle, soothing sound that complements the spa&#8217;s relaxing atmosphere.</li>
<li data-start="969" data-end="1120"><strong data-start="971" data-end="998">Customizable Aesthetics</strong> &#8211; Tailor the water wall to match your space with various glass finishes, lighting options, and engraving possibilities.</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="1127" data-end="1159"><strong data-start="1131" data-end="1157">Customization Options:</strong></h3>
<h4 data-start="1161" data-end="1188"><strong data-start="1166" data-end="1186">1. Size &amp; Shape:</strong></h4>
<ul data-start="1189" data-end="1320">
<li data-start="1189" data-end="1320">Choose from a variety of heights and widths to perfectly fit your space, with options for single or multi-panel configurations.</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start="1322" data-end="1357"><strong data-start="1327" data-end="1355">2. Materials &amp; Finishes:</strong></h4>
<ul data-start="1358" data-end="1511">
<li data-start="1358" data-end="1435">Select from clear, frosted, or textured glass finishes for a unique look.</li>
<li data-start="1436" data-end="1511">Opt for polished or brushed stainless steel frames to match your décor.</li>
